Sun Jun 21 11:54:29 UTC 2026 - Michael Pujos <pujos.michael@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.8.3:
  - Mouse menu controls have been added! They're off by default, enable in
    the "Modern Options" menu (renamed from "New Options")
  - cl_gun_fovscale cvar that allows for non-distorted gun models on high FOVs
  -  Fixed lit water on maps where not all water is lit (like QFM e2m1)
  - Fixed lit water on maps without colored lighting (like Ritual start)
  - Fixed SoA Track 02 not playing
  - Fixed resurrect command after using LG underwater (thanks @puppluka)
  - Other minor fixes

